    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17818" root="زغب" body-key="z">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ازدغب مَا عَلَى الخِوَانِ</span></b>  <i>He took away,</i> or
<i>swept away,</i> [or <i>devoured,</i>] <i>the whole of what
was on the table of food:</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ازدغف</span>. (TA.)
[See also 8 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زعب</span>.]

